1
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:14,740
Please ask Master Fang Qingcheng to come out and speak.

2
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,060
I am Fang Zhuozhuo, paying my respects to Madam.

3
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:30,160
Paying respects to all the noble ladies.

4
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,720
You two sisters

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,360
are really interesting.

6
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,280
Substituting for marriage isn't enough;

7
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,720
you also substitute for the competition.

8
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,120
My cousin hasn't returned yet.

9
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,520
I really couldn't bear to see

10
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:43,320
Yanzhi Pavilion's years of hard work go to waste.

11
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:46,680
So I specifically took this opportunity to display the Flying Phoenix in Flames.

12
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,560
Every brushstroke on this

13
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,680
was developed by my cousin

14
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:52,010
and the sisters in the pavilion together.

15
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:54,720
Since all the ladies agree on its quality,

16
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:57,120
I hope Madam will make a fair decision

17
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:59,920
and grant Yanzhi Pavilion the honor it deserves.

18
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,160
Come here.

19
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,240
Nanny Chang.

20
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,360
I am here.

21
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:10,320
Move this Nine-Phoenix Candlestick over there.

22
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,000
I want to see

23
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,080
if this Flying Phoenix in Flames

24
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:16,640
is worthy of the title of champion.

25
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:17,560
Yes.

26
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,420
Someone, come.

27
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,640
Behave!

28
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,039
No!

29
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,080
Stop!

30
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,450
It hurts!

31
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,640
Let me go!

32
00:01:36,039 --> 00:01:37,900
What does this have to do with her?

33
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,759
It's truly exquisite.

34
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,920
Bring it closer to me.

35
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,440
No!

36
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,240
Just now, Madam

37
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:21,520
seemed to appreciate this Flying Phoenix in Flames very much.

38
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,480
It's me being blind.

39
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,079
How can such vulgar makeup

40
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,800
match Madam's natural beauty?

41
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,280
It is truly difficult to be

42
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,680
the champion of the Makeup Selection Ceremony.

43
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,760
Even gold and iron

44
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,760
will melt in a raging fire.

45
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,120
Madam's action

46
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,600
not only damages the official reputation of the ceremony,

47
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:42,480
but also chills the hearts of all the makeup artists in Kuizhou.

48
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,360
How dare you!

49
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,240
A repudiated thin slave

50
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:48,400
dares to argue with me?

51
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,600
From the moment you stepped into the gates of this Governor's Mansion,

52
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,040
it was a capital offense.

53
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,040
No matter how exquisite

54
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,800
your makeup is,

55
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,680
a thin woman's makeup

56
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:00,440
is inherently lowly.

57
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,200
Guards!

58
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:08,920
Drag this thin slave who violated the Crime Appearance Doctrine away

59
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:09,960
and lock her

60
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,680
in the death cell.

61
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,640
The copper rouge box you mentioned,

62
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,440
where is it now?

63
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,280
Madam,

64
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,660
you're finally willing to see me.

65
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:24,680
Speak.

66
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,880
It's with Chu Shengyi.

67
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,840
Madam is so smart;

68
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,730
naturally, you can guess everything.

69
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,880
Chu Shengyi even tried to cancel

70
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,880
the engagement with the Cheng family for you.

71
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,440
And you have the heart to betray him.

72
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,060
Deliberately luring me here,

73
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,140
what exactly do you want to do?

74
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,120
I only ask Madam

75
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,890
to acknowledge Yanzhi Pavilion's

76
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,460
position as the champion.

77
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,800
For a mere Yanzhi Pavilion,

78
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,920
you're willing to betray your beloved?

79
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:11,180
My cousin has been very kind to me.

80
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,440
I hope Madam will grant this.

81
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,360
Fang

82
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,240
Qingcheng.

83
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,960
Madam,

84
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,770
you actually have Qionghua Rouge too.

85
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,400
I should have known

86
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,220
I'd been played by you for so long.

87
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,800
I can make it so that even after the rouge's poison flares up,

88
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:35,060
you can maintain your plump appearance.

89
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,560
For this rouge,

90
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:40,360
there are only two ways

91
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,720
to revert the effects.

92
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,250
One is to wipe it off in time,

93
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,000
and the other is for the poison to fade away.

94
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,720
But if the poison penetrates too deeply for too long,

95
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,120
the duration will become

96
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,320
shorter and shorter.

97
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,409
For me right now,

98
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,640
it's 12 hours.

99
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,210
Madam, you've been using it

100
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,460
longer than I have.

101
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:58,920
I'm afraid

102
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,360
it's less than 8 hours now.

103
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:09,120
If this rouge is not reapplied after the poison flares up,

104
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,080
you will definitely revert to your original appearance,

105
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,680
which is quite troublesome.

106
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,120
So over the years,

107
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,440
I've been looking for a formula

108
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,880
to extend the duration of

109
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,600
this transforming rouge,

110
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,520
and I've gained quite some insights.

111
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,040
With just a few more tries,

112
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,720
I will definitely be able

113
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,560
to make a Qionghua Rouge

114
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:28,680
that transforms you permanently.

115
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,320
Really?

116
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,680
My life

117
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,040
is already in your hands, Madam.

118
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,240
Madam,

119
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:43,040
why not trust me this once?

120
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,920
If it really works,

121
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,400
I

122
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,840
will spare your miserable life.

123
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:24,960
Three days from now is the final of the Makeup Selection Ceremony.

124
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:27,840
I will participate in the competition as Qingcheng then.

125
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:29,240
When the time is right,

126
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:32,180
I will reveal my true face in front of Lady Li.

127
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:36,040
Substituting in the competition after substituting in the marriage,

128
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,040
Lady Li will definitely be furious.

129
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,680
Since she needs to control me,

130
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,480
she definitely won't take your life immediately.

131
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,180
After I'm imprisoned,

132
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:47,600
I'll find a way to lure her to meet me.

133
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:49,850
Then I'll intentionally expose a flaw

134
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:52,320
to let her know I also have the Qionghua Rouge.

135
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,520
And then tell her

136
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:57,580
that I have a way to extend the duration of the transformation.

137
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,770
She will definitely take the bait.

138
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,500
Have you figured out a method?

139
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,520
I have an idea.

140
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:06,520
If I can control the poison when it flares up,

141
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,960
perhaps I can extend the transformation time.

142
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,890
That will be enough to fool Lady Li.

143
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:15,760
I have received Jiaojiao's letter from the Western Regions.

144
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,800
She said there is a type of grass

145
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,800
that always grows next to the Qionghua flower.

146
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,000
We might give it a try.

147
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,010
How sure are you?

148
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:23,840
Fifty-fifty.

149
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,120
But

150
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:27,530
it's worth a gamble.

151
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,520
Her real issue is with me.

152
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:35,760
You can

153
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:38,400
use the bronze box rouge as an excuse

154
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,860
to lure her out to meet you.

155
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,260
You want me to sell you out?

156
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,159
No.

157
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,800
It's too risky.

158
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:48,500
All these years, Zier has been searching

159
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:52,800
for circumstantial evidence of her murdering my mother.

160
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:57,120
Only by releasing the evidence from back then

161
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,600
will she reveal her flaws.

162
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,200
Don't worry.

163
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,440
Her tricks over the years,

164
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,600
I have long figured them out.

165
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:12,720
Chu Shengyi,

166
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,920
you must hold on.

167
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:26,400
My Lord.

168
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,640
This hairpin,

169
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,640
it was on your birthday back then

170
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,440
that I personally put it on you.

171
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,640
My Lord,

172
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,090
you still remember.

173
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,930
Having too good a memory

174
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,720
is not necessarily a good thing.

175
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,720
My Lord,

176
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,820
is something on your mind?

177
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,800
You know

178
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,840
the knot in my heart all these years.

179
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,320
I have decided to let Yi'er

180
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,080
succeed as the heir.

181
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,280
Aunt Zhao's past affairs,

182
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,820
do not mention them in front of him

183
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,760
ever again.

184
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,120
I understand.

185
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,000
As for the salt trade,

186
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,560
these days,

187
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,760
let Yi'er follow your brother

188
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,800
to learn more.

189
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,760
He is intelligent

190
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,520
and will surely be of great help.

191
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:40,160
Since you have spoken,

192
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,160
I will naturally obey.

193
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,480
You are Yi'er's mother.

194
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:53,040
As long as you treat him well,

195
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,160
what you want,

196
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,920
you will naturally get.

197
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,200
My Lord,

198
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,280
won't you stay for a meal?

199
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,980
The kitchen made your favorite pineapple cake.

200
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,400
Keep it for yourself.

201
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,600
What I want most

202
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,160
has always been only you, My Lord.

203
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,720
I didn't kill you,

204
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,320
I didn't.

205
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:16,200
I killed someone again.

206
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,560
Madam.

207
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,400
Madam.

208
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,280
The Commander left

209
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:29,280
definitely because he is busy.

210
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,200
Madam, in his heart,

211
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:34,320
you are always unmatched.

212
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,880
Perhaps in the past.

213
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,880
But now,

214
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:43,600
he has his flawless good son.

215
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,320
What am I?

216
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:53,480
Not only does he bring Chu Shengyi to discuss political affairs,

217
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,370
even the salt trade,

218
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,600
he wants my brother to hand over.

219
00:12:57,640 --> 00:13:01,100
He is trying to strip the Li family of all their wealth and power

220
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:04,680
to pave the way for his beloved.

221
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,200
Madam.

222
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,720
Madam.

223
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,400
Even if Chu Shengyi

224
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,400
lives to be the heir,

225
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,480
he may not live

226
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,240
to be the Lord of Kui State.

227
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,080
Zhuozhuo.

228
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,640
She escaped.

229
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,000
Mother,

230
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,120
why are you here?

231
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,380
Your breathing is getting sluggish,

232
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:58,520
and your limbs feel like lead,

233
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:02,680
right?

234
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:03,560
You...

235
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,440
poisoned me.

236
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:10,720
The news of Fang Zhuozhuo being at Qiwu Courtyard,

237
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,760
find a way to leak it out,

238
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:15,210
and lure him to the private garden.

239
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,680
There is poison in the blood.

240
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,960
I taught you long ago

241
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:29,060
to be vigilant about everything.

242
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,680
But you,

243
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,600
after all these years,

244
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,680
have you ever truly listened to me?

245
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,140
Soul-Suppressing Talisman.

246
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,920
Wonderful, isn't it?

247
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:54,320
These people

248
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:57,680
will never be reincarnated for eternity.

249
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,280
Even their souls

250
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,810
will be trapped here to suffer,

251
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:07,080
including

252
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,920
your mother.

253
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,600
It really is with you.

254
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,400
The makeup artist from Yanzhi Pavilion delivered the materials.

255
00:16:48,400 --> 00:16:50,000
Have the items been checked?

256
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,820
Everything has been checked.

257
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,640
Why is this here?

258
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:23,280
This item once grew beside Qionghua.

259
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,540
It might be worth a try.

260
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:55,000
Madam.

261
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,800
An urgent dispatch from Anzhou.

262
00:17:56,880 --> 00:18:00,410
The edict granting the concubine title has crossed Qingjiang.

263
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,560
After all these years,

264
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:10,800
it's finally my turn.

265
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:16,840
Chu Shengyi is dead.

266
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:18,280
If that lowly slave

267
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,400
can really make

268
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:22,730
the Qionghua rouge that brings permanent transformation,

269
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:26,240
then in the Master's eyes

270
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:27,720
and heart,

271
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:30,800
there will only ever be me.
